# Timely design system

Landing and app share one system. Presentation must come from `apps/web/src/theme/tokens.ts`, `apps/web/src/app/globals.css`, and `apps/web/src/components/ui`.

**Palette:** warm canvas `#F1F0EC`, surfaces `#FFFFFF`, ink `#0B0F14`, navy `#0F141C`, accent blue `#2563EB`, indigo/violet for AI, emerald for paid/success. Do not invent colours, type sizes, radii, shadows, or motion on a page. Do not wrap every section in a card. White cards must clearly lift off the warm canvas via `--shadow-elevated`.

**Type:** `Text` / `.ti-display` `.ti-h1` `.ti-h2` `.ti-h3` `.ti-body` `.ti-small` `.ti-caption` `.ti-financial-display` `.ti-financial-value` `.ti-meta`. Financial figures use `Amount` or `.ti-amount` (tabular mono).

**Surfaces:** `Surface` variants `primary | secondary | elevated | dark | interactive | flush`. Prefer soft border + layered elevation (`--shadow-elevated`). Flush + typography + dividers when a card is unnecessary. Do not wrap every section in a card.

**Page uniqueness:** Dashboard may use navy `.ti-kpi-card` strips. Other pages should feel distinct — use soft `.ti-stat-card` metrics, flush financial heroes, or list-first shells. Do not clone the dashboard layout onto Money / Insights / list pages.

**Controls:** `Button` (`primary secondary tertiary ghost danger success`, `loading`) — **primary actions use navy** (`--tl-navy`), not accent blue; blue is for links, focus rings, and charts. `Input`, `Select`, `Textarea`, `Field`, `Badge`, `Tabs` / `SectionTabs`, `Table`, dropdown, `Modal`, `Tooltip`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorState`, `Skeleton`, `PageHeader`, `SectionHeader`. Toasts via `notifySuccess` / `notifyError` only. Buttons use pill radius.

**Motion:** 120 / 180 / 280 / 400ms and `--ti-ease`. No decorative animation.

```tsx
// ❌
<div className="rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-xl p-6"><p className="text-3xl">{total}</p></div>

// ✅
<SectionHeader kicker="Outstanding" />
<Amount display>{formatMoney(total, currency)}</Amount>
```
